STHFX2,	S7600			/WHERE IT SHOULD BE MOVED TO
STHFX3,	SBTFUN			/POINTER TO BOOTSTRAP UNIT FUNCTION
STHFX4,	SETCIF			/WHERE CIF EXHGFLD IS
